NAME
       railscasts - a warm, dark Neovim colorscheme

SYNOPSIS
       railscasts [--high-contrast] [--transparent]

OPTIONS
       -h, --high-contrast
              Increase contrast for muted text.

SEE ALSO
       nvim(1), kitty(1)

